From 14e8ea245e6f1078b762ead9731d417499866315 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew Gibson <mgibson041387@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 23:24:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Add bulk metadata editor for batch editing item
 properties

New dashboard page for bulk editing movie/show metadata: search items,
then apply updates to genres, tags, official rating, and community rating
across selected results. Uses library search to find matching items.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
